comment0.text=\r\n\ An\ interface\ (a\ "contract")\ that\ all\ bosses\ must\ follow.\r\n\ This\ allows\ a\ single\ health\ bar\ to\ track\ ANY\ boss.\r\n\ *\ It\ extends\ Damageable,\ so\ all\ bosses\ MUST\ also\ have\ a\r\n\ takeDamage(int\ amount)\ method.\r\n
